    - rid: 4707331669776663335
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle after a Second Wind frees you from the hunter (shown ~3 s, one line at the bottom of the screen)
    - rid: 4707331669776663336
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Salesman subtitle after the player takes a contract (shown 3 s)
    - rid: 4707331669776663337
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Salesman subtitle after the player declines or drops a contract (shown 2.5 s)
    - rid: 4707331669776663338
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle after a star is taken loudly enough for the hunter to hear (shown ~2 s)
    - rid: 4707331669776663339
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Subtitle: pressed the spare-battery key with none held (1.8 s)'
    - rid: 4707331669776663340
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Subtitle: tried to use a consumable while hidden in a locker (1.8 s)'
    - rid: 4707331669776663341
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Subtitle: tried to use a spare battery with a full torch (1.8 s)'
    - rid: 4707331669776663342
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Subtitle: a spare battery was used (1.8 s)'
    - rid: 4707331669776663343
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Subtitle: pressed the star-compass key with none held (1.8 s)'
    - rid: 4707331669776663344
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Subtitle: the star compass has nothing left to point at (1.8 s)'
    - rid: 4707331669776663345
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle when the last key is picked up on a key-hunt floor with a hatch (2.5 s)
    - rid: 4707331669776663346
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle when the last key is picked up on a key-hunt floor with a lift (2.5 s)
    - rid: 4707331672703763101
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle after picking up a battery cell in the maze (shown 2 s, one line at the bottom of the screen)
    - rid: 4707331672703763102
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle after a vault battery cell also grants a Second Wind (shown 3 s). Second Wind = the shop item that frees you once when the hunter catches you
    - rid: 4707331672703763103
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle after picking up a key on a key-hunt floor (shown 2 s). {held} = keys held, {total} = keys on the floor
    - rid: 4707331672703763104
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle the first time a note or file is read this campaign (shown 2.5 s). {amount} = shards awarded, {currency} = currency name (SHARDS)
    - rid: 4707331672703763105
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle when an unattended lantern lures the hunter (shown 3 s, only when the player is far away). "Something" = the hunter, never named
    - rid: 4707331672703763106
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle after pressing a wall button whose shutter is out of sight (shown 3 s)
    - rid: 4707331672703763107
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle when the Laboratory terminal is used and shows the hunter's position (shown 3 s). CAM 3 = a security camera name, keep it short
    - rid: 4707331672703763108
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle when the robot stalker (Stan) touches you and screams, when he has no speech voice (shown 2.5 s). "IT" = Stan
    - rid: 4707331672703763109
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle when the active contract is failed mid-floor (shown 3 s). {name} = contract name (no final period; the sentence adds one)
    - rid: 4707331672703763110
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle when the active contract is completed mid-floor (shown 3 s). {name} = contract name (no final period; the sentence adds one)
    - rid: 4707331672703763111
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle at the start of a floor that has no shards when the "Take what glitters" contract was taken (shown on run start)
    - rid: 4707331672703763112
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle at the start of a floor that has no notes when the "Read it all" contract was taken (shown on run start)
    - rid: 4707331672703763113
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Salesman line the next time the shop opens after a contract was completed (shown 3 s)
    - rid: 4707331672703763114
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Salesman line the next time the shop opens after a contract was failed (shown 3 s)
    - rid: 4707331672703763115
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Salesman greeting when the shop opens after floor 1 (shown 3 s). Shards = the currency
    - rid: 4707331672703763116
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Salesman greeting when the shop opens after floor 2 (shown 3 s)
    - rid: 4707331672703763117
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Salesman greeting when the shop opens after floor 3 (shown 3 s)
    - rid: 4707331672703763118
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Salesman greeting when the shop opens after floor 4 (shown 3 s)
    - rid: 4707331672703763122
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle when the first lamps die as the maze empties of stars (shown 2.6 s)
    - rid: 4707331672703763124
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle, once per campaign, the first time an ambush ends because the star it guarded was taken (shown 2.6 s). "It" = the hunter
    - rid: 4707331672703763125
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Floor intro banner title when the floor has no named look (96 pt, one line). {floor} = floor number
    - rid: 4707331672703763126
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Floor intro banner title (96 pt, one line, 1400 px, auto-size). {floor} = floor number, {theme} = the look's name in capitals (shop.theme.*)
    - rid: 4707331672703763127
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Floor intro banner objective part (always 2 or more stars; parts are joined with a middle dot). {n} = stars to find
    - rid: 4707331672703763128
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Floor intro banner objective part on a blackout floor. {n} = fuse boxes to restore (3)
    - rid: 4707331672703763129
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Floor intro banner objective part on a key-hunt floor. {n} = keys to find (2 or 3); the hatch is the floor exit
    - rid: 4707331672703763130
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Floor intro banner objective part on a floor with a timed security door
    - rid: 4707331672703763131
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Floor intro banner rule line (one line, auto-size). {name} = the rule name (shop.rule.*.name), {description} = its sentence (shop.rule.*.desc)
    - rid: 4707331674882703723
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World text (the game speaking, not the hunter) when a noise the player made stops the hunter dead, just before it rushes the spot (shown 2 s). ALL CAPS like THE HATCH IS UNLOCKED. "IT" = the hunter, never named
    - rid: 4707331677479764078
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Floor intro banner objective part on the final floor, whose exit is always the lift. {n} = keys to find (3)
    - rid: 4707331677479764079
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World text (the game speaking, not the hunter) shown at the start of a floor on the hunter-lesson card (42 pt goal line, shrinks to fit) when the hunter has learned the player's locker habit. ALL CAPS like IT HEARD YOU. "IT" = the hunter, never named
    - rid: 4707331677479764080
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World text (the game speaking, not the hunter) shown at the start of a floor on the hunter-lesson card (42 pt goal line, shrinks to fit) when the hunter has learned the player's throwing habit. ALL CAPS like IT HEARD YOU. "IT" = the hunter, never named
    - rid: 4707331677479764081
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World text (the game speaking, not the hunter) shown at the start of a floor on the hunter-lesson card (42 pt goal line, shrinks to fit) when the hunter has learned the player's dark-walking habit. ALL CAPS like IT HEARD YOU. "IT" = the hunter, never named
    - rid: 4707331677479764082
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World text (the game speaking, not the hunter) shown at the start of a floor on the hunter-lesson card (42 pt goal line, shrinks to fit) when the hunter has learned the player's sprinting habit. ALL CAPS like IT HEARD YOU. "IT" = the hunter, never named
    - rid: 4707331677479764495
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'World text (the game speaking) when the looping corridor seals behind the player (shown 4 s, one line at the bottom of the screen). The rule of the spot-the-anomaly puzzle: a wrong lap means turn back. ALL CAPS like IT HEARD YOU'
    - rid: 4707331677479764496
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World text when the player has solved the looping corridor and is let out with the floor map (shown 3.5 s). ALL CAPS like IT HEARD YOU
    - rid: 4707331677479764497
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World text after a Second Wind lets the player go from the looping corridor's Visitor (shown 3.2 s). "IT" = the Visitor, never named. ALL CAPS like IT HEARD YOU
